00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:40.000
you need so much help, you're sent to the fifth building. The magical curative powers of the architecture and the Kirk-Bride plan and keeping active would make you a little bit better and you'd go to four and then three, two, one, and then you'd walk out the front doors. Since each of the pavilions would be set back slightly from the last, attendance could easily open windows on all four sides, aiding in ventilation. The narrowed points of contact between sections also protected against
使得更容易将设施的任何一部分与其他部分隔离开来。大自然本身被认为是具有治愈作用的，因此柯克布赖德要求精神病院被公园绿地环绕。这意味着当你走在建筑层叠的走廊和高高的天花板下时，你转向几乎任何方向，都能看到高耸的绿地和天空景观。其理念是让精神病院感觉像一个维多利亚时代的家，每个病房都应该像一个理想的维多利亚家庭单位。所以他们在一起做所有事情。

